#                ai.>  mem.>  ops.>  obs.>
#
# `ui_gateway` is the SOLE publisher on `trader.intent.*` (R21.1). Every
# manual trader action (kill-switch, strategy toggle, priority change,
# manual order intent) flows through this credential.
